sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant API
  participant DB
  participant Outbox
  participant SB as Service Bus
  participant Worker
  Client->>API: POST /v1/scans + API key
  API->>API: derive tenant + validate scope
  API->>DB: BEGIN insert scans PENDING + billing RESERVED + idempotency
  API->>DB: insert outbox_events scan.requested
  API->>DB: COMMIT
  API-->>Client: 201 scanId + idempotencyKey + billingState RESERVED
  Outbox->>DB: claim PENDING outbox
  Outbox->>SB: publish scan.requested sessionId=tenantId
  Outbox->>DB: mark PUBLISHED
  Worker->>SB: accept tenant session
  Worker->>DB: PENDING -> IN_PROGRESS + scan_attempt
  Worker->>Worker: resource preflight + modules + retry/backoff
  Worker->>DB: save scan_results + DONE/FAILED
  Worker->>DB: billing CONSUMED or REFUNDED
  Client->>API: GET /v1/scans/{scanId}
  API-->>Client: JSON / PDF
